# The sort direction button (▲/▼) belongs to the Stock Monitor's list: a stock's detail view must
# not show it (nor the sort or the filter tabs), and going back to "All stocks" shows it again.
# UI only; the player's monitor settings are put back.
name Stock Monitor: a stock's detail view hides the list's sort controls; back shows them again
monitor remember
monitor close
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorButton
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-Oil
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetail
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
capture monitor-detail-no-sort
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorBack
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
cleanup:
monitor close
monitor restore
